</head>
<body>

    <!-- Your existing HTML content (header, axioms, SVG, scale table, viral section, etc.) -->

    <div class="header">
        <div class="phi-symbol">Φ</div>
        <h1>Macachor Density Distortion Isolation</h1>
        <div class="subtitle">v17.0 — The Fibonacci Spiral Weaves Tetrahedra</div>
        <div class="equation">F(n) = F(n-1) + F(n-2) → lim(n→∞) F(n)/F(n+1) = 𝔐 = 0.618...</div>
